{
  "_readme": "Languages the agent can speak, with the ISO code ElevenLabs expects. The console shows 'English (en)' so nobody has to know the code. `tts` lists which ElevenLabs models support the language: flash = eleven_flash_v2_5 / turbo_v2_5, multi = eleven_multilingual_v2, v3 = eleven_v3. `native` is the language's own name, used to write the opener in-language.",
